**Read:** [Research Software Engineering with Python — Irving and colleagues](../sources/Research-Software-Engineering.lingua#r_07D4PDD4HGKNK3PW4M90YSV2QY), the program-organization, functions, and packaging chapters; [The Good Research Code Handbook — Mineault and community](../sources/Good-Research-Code.lingua#r_771ZMSHAY1TCSTFCHPT9KZRA66), Write decoupled code completely; [Environments, dependency records, and packaging — PyPA](../sources/Python-Environments-and-Packaging.lingua#r_5VVAF04TH8R3DRY9Z36308BH88), distribution package versus import package.

In the worked program, calculate receives interpreted values and returns quantities. load_rows owns the tabular contract. build_report owns output meaning and serialization preparation. run owns filesystem interaction, and main owns the command-line interface. These boundaries let another implementation or test exercise the mathematics without reproducing the shell or directory layout.

Importing analyze must not run the command or overwrite a report. The main guard makes invocation explicit. A module's top-level state still matters: imported dependencies can have side effects and module constants can conceal parameters. Inspect rather than assuming every import is inert. Use a small public interface and keep the meaning of its inputs stable during an analysis.

Decomposition should reveal decisions. A helper called process_data hides more than one called dry_component_mass if its role is a specific physical conversion. Conversely, splitting each arithmetic operator into a separate module makes the scientific relationship harder to inspect. Compare candidate boundaries by asking whether a reader can independently check the actual transformation and whether failures identify a useful part of the work.

**Work:** import analyze in a fresh interpreter and call calculate with exact fractions for a single lot. Verify that no files appear. Then replace the CSV reader with a reader for an explicitly documented alternative format while keeping calculate unchanged. Compare results for equivalent inputs and identify what the format adapter is responsible for validating.

Read the complete organization and function material in the research-software book, and the handbook's decoupling chapter. Extend the project into a small package only when several modules or callers justify it. Learn the official packaging distinction between an import package and a distribution package before treating an installed distribution's name as proof of which source code was imported.

